# Emissaries of God (abyssea 182), the title list: five level 99 Warriors in Port Jeuno with Death and Rebirth completed
# and the quest accepted, each holding five of the six caturae titles and lacking a different one (Iratham Capturer,
# Kutharei Unhorser, Sippoy Capturer, Yaanei Crasher, Rani Decrowner; the main flow's char lacks Raja Regicide; GMs).
# Joachim, for each: no section (his script's 328). So a list entry read as its neighbour (the next one, the last one's
# the first) holds all six where the Lua does not.
lists PortJeuno/Joachim/onTrigger PortJeuno/onEventFinish/328
